Using the lesson's `Initials` function (shown again below), what does the last line print?

```csharp
string Initials(string fullName)
{
    string result = "";
    foreach (string part in fullName.Split(' '))
    {
        result += part[0];
    }
    return result;
}
Console.WriteLine(Initials("Ngozi Okonjo Iweala").ToLower());
```
